#83200
"A Narrow Spiral Stair"
"To the east and west of you, crude wooden doors bound with iron strips mark

the entrances to this level of the dungeon.  A crude stone spiral stairway

makes its way upwards in a haphazard fashion.  Widely spaced torches give dim

light to the area, making the stairway a dangerous place for the unwary

traveler.

"
""
