#83204
"Intersetion in the Halls"
"The hallway comes to an intersection here.  One hall leads to the west, the

other to the north and south.  The walls, celing, and floor are made up of

large worn granite slabs.  The hallway is faintly lit by small glowing orbs

placed intermittantly on the walls.

