#83206
"A Dimly Lit Passage"
"Stretching to the north and south, this dimly lit hallway is made of

predomidantly large granite blocks.  As it slopes slightly down to the north,

smaller brownish sandstone blocks are used for support.  Many of the small

cracks and holes in the walls seem to have become homes to small vermin.

