#83210
"A Dimly Lit Passage"
"You have come to an intersection of hallways.  One leads off to the north

while the other heads west.  It seems that the hallway may continue to the

east, but a collapse obstructs an immediate view of the passage.  The hallways

themselves look very similar, as both are made up of the same granite slabs

that compose the rest of the dungeon.  Small glowing orbs give off a faint

light in each direction.

"
""
