"collapse e east"
"Granite slabs have crumbled from the ceiling to block off the passageway to

the east.  Although the damage to the hall is extensive, there appears to be a

small opening in the wreckage which one might squeeze through with effort.

"
E
"orb light"
"Small grey-white glowing orbs give of light from various places along the

hall.  They rest in small indents in the walls.

"
