#83213
"A Dimly Lit Passage"
"Water drips from the ceiling forming a large puddle on the floor.  The sound

echoes strangely off the granite slabs which make up the passage.  The lone

glowing orb in the area casts strange reflections off of the water, giving the

vicinity more of an eerie feeling than it had before.  The hall continues to

the north and west.

"
""
