"large puddle"
"Water dripping from the ceiling has formed a large black puddle on the stone

floor.  Ripples scuttle across it as new drops fall.

"
E
"slabs walls floor"
"Grey stone blocks make up the structure of the entire hall.  Each is about

four feet in width and length, making it a wonder that they could be used in

construction.  These slabs look to have no way of shifting from their

appointed positions.

"
